<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: mobile gas cooker -->
  <MobileGasCooker.label>便攜燃氣爐</MobileGasCooker.label>
  <!-- EN: A portable gas cooker widely used by adventurers throughout the rim. The mobile gas cooker is used to cook simple and fine meals, barbeque some delicious skewers, and re-heat army rations into delicious army ration meals. It uses chemfuel as fuel, and it is very efficient in fuel consumption. -->
  <MobileGasCooker.description>深受邊緣世界冒險家們喜愛的便攜式燃氣爐。功能不及普通料理桌多，但依然能用來烹調簡單和精緻料理、燒烤肉串以及加熱軍糧。需要添加化合燃料才能工作，燃料的消耗速度很慢。</MobileGasCooker.description>
  
</LanguageData>